<http://www.projecthalo.com/aura#Condition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Condition" .
<http://www.projecthalo.com/aura#Condition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.projecthalo.com/aura#State> .
<http://www.projecthalo.com/aura#Event> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.projecthalo.com/aura#Event> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Event" .
<http://www.projecthalo.com/aura#State> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.projecthalo.com/aura#State> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "State" .
<http://www.projecthalo.com/aura#State> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.projecthalo.com/aura#Event> .
